2026-07-27T08:59:43.5532185Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:59:43.5532729Z i /tmp/RtmpHTliFK/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:59:43.5533094Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:59:43.5533475Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:59:43.5534186Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:59:43.5534682Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:59:43.5535557Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:59:43.5536146Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
